# Conventional Commits

When the user asks to commit, the message **must** be Conventional Commits. Full rules: `docs/style/commits.md`.

```
<type>(<optional-scope>): <short why>
```

Types: `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `docs`, `style`, `chore`, `perf`, `revert`.

```
# ✅
feat(mount-daun): add auto carry and auto accept carry
fix(mount-noxera): wait for GameplayPaused before summit teleports
docs: add agent knowledge base and commit rules

# ❌
Add Auto Carry to Mount Daun.
update stuff
WIP
```

- Imperative, lowercase description, no trailing period, header ≤ 72 chars.
- Scope examples: `loader`, `sempat-ui`, `tabs`, `mount-daun`.
- Split unrelated changes. Do not commit unless asked.
